A state machine that declares no `artifact:` matches no file by its path, so a report naming no
`--playbook` finds no playbook to report and asks for the flag. Paired with
`a-machine-without-an-artifact-reports-the-named-file.txtar`.

-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-targetless/playbook.md --
---
name: fx-targetless
title: Targetless
summary: Machine with no declared artifact, addressed by its file.
---

Preamble.
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-targetless/playbook.yaml --
state: main
graph:
  review: []

states:
  main:
    initial: reviewing
    statuses:
      reviewing:
        transitions:
          - to: reviewed
            when: the review is written
      reviewed: {terminal: true}
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-targetless/review/prompt.md --
